# Run-output segregation (GAIA-009): everything under outputs/ is generated
# state — meshes, OpenFOAM cases, STL dumps, and review rasters — regenerated
# by the examples (`cargo run --example <name>`) and the book gallery bin.
# Reviewed golden figures are the committed SVGs in docs/book/figures/; review
# rasters regenerate from them on demand (rsvg-convert) and stay out of git.
outputs/
